    "statements": [
      {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "Using the same hibiscus extract, similar drop amounts of each sample, and recording both final colours makes the comparison fair."
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "text": "Using one drop of lemon juice and ten drops of soap water is fair if the indicator is the same and both final colours are recorded."
      },
      {
